   ('Function: the apprentice as audit', 'Fu\'s naivety is an auditing device: because he understands nothing of the trade, every part of it — agents, tests, information sales, fund terms — has to be explained in his hearing, and the audience receives the underworld\'s operating manual through his induction. The analysis here is structural: remove Fu\'s innocence and the film loses both its exposition engine and its moral baseline.'),
